# Publish notes, patches and scripts only.
# Camfrog binaries, built DLLs, the registry export (personal settings and block
# list) and screenshots (other people's names and chat) stay local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!crash-patch.txt
!camfrog/
camfrog/*
!camfrog/*.py
!camfrog/*.sh
!camfrog/*.patch
!wine-patches/
wine-patches/*
!wine-patches/*.patch
# build-patched-wine.sh replays the series onto this commit; without it a fresh
# clone cannot verify or rebuild the patched tree.
!wine-patches/base
!v4l2loopback/
v4l2loopback/*
!v4l2loopback/*.conf
!build-patched-wine.sh
!camfrog-wine.sh
